        "id": 224854,
        "name": "Gus_Smedstad",
        "username": "Gus_Smedstad",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/e8c25b/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-01-03T15:01:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Freedom 5 Tachyon gets&nbsp;<em>more</em>&nbsp;out of Research Grant than basic Tachyon IMHO.</p>\n<p>It’s true that&nbsp;F5 Tachyon will sometimes forgo Research Grant for Blitz because she needs damage now, or wants to finish off a target and is willing to burn Burst cards to do it. Basic Tachyon never uses Rapid Recon if she can use Research Grant.</p>\n<p>However, F5 Tachyon gets more benefit from trashed Burst cards than basic Tachyon. Skipping Blitz one turn gives up 1 damage, plus any damage bonuses. A Burst card trashed by Research Grant is worth that same 1 damage in a later Blitz, plus a card draw, plus 1 damage to every Lightspeed Barrage.</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:58:20.241Z",
