        "id": 224855,
        "name": "Missingno",
        "username": "Missingno",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/missingno/{size}/2049_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-01-04T06:27:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>OKAY!&nbsp; GEEZ!&nbsp; I GET IT NOW!&nbsp; TACH CAN THOUSAND CUTS SOMEONE!&nbsp; Super close call mint with bunker down and everyone else at 1 HP.</p>\n<p>I used the freeze and tach strat as well, though Wraith and Bunker were doing their fair share of shooting.&nbsp; The only thing that kept me from dying was tach's second hypersonic assault.&nbsp; Careful with this one, there's two bombs back to back in the deck that will end you and wraith can't reall grab her eyepeice this time until late in the game.</p>",
