      {
        "id": 224859,
        "name": "KateWalker",
        "username": "TakeWalker",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-01-04T23:34:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Forgot to mention, the suggestion to get Legacy Leading from the Front early and setting him to energy damage is&nbsp;<em>really</em>&nbsp;important. Tachyon can deal with the EPEs on a one-for-one basis no problem, but all the (H)-based damage is energy. You need Legacy soaking that 45 damage per round, plus the occasional Android.</p>",
