        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/e8c25b/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-01-05T02:01:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If I'm reading QuirkyDM's post correctly, he didn't do the Legacy Lead from the Front / Energy immunity thing. Instead he used Throat Jab / Hypersonic Assault x 3 / kill Omnitron in round 5. I'd have to experiment with that to see how that works out.</p>",
