      {
        "id": 224862,
        "name": "bolnerap",
        "username": "bolnerap",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bolnerap/{size}/6056_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-01-05T02:47:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mint with HP 13 / 2 / 16 / 6 / 6.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I'd intended to start getting AZ set up, but &nbsp;when I drew Fueled Freeze, that was the end of that idea. From blowing up three Ongoings and having two ways to stop Omnitron's damage in hand at the start, I bet that if I went all-in on Tachyon card draw and damage, I'd kill him before he could do anything else. I was right. Never saw the third LSB, but I did enough damage to take him down on the same round the second EPE came out.</p>",
