      {
        "id": 224864,
        "name": "FrivYeti",
        "username": "FrivYeti",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/frivyeti/{size}/1919_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-01-06T00:50:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I ended up with a ludicrous near-mint win, based on the following strategy:</p>\n<p>Legacy gives Tachyon card plays, which she uses for her bursts that draw cards.</p>\n<p>AZ does his thing and tries not to die.</p>\n<p>Wraith goes in for maximum card draw, and uses her funding to funnel it all to Tachyon.</p>\n<p>Bunker uses his power to give Tachyon extra top-decks.</p>\n<p>Tachyon draws enough cards to use Hypersonic Assault literally every turn for the whole game.</p>\n<p>I still almost died from late-played drones, but I pulled it off.&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 31,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:58:20.949Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
